000400*================================================================
000500* PRMRULES  UNDERWRITING RULE TABLE
000600*
000700* CALLED BY PRMCALC (BATCH) AND PRMCALC0 (CICS) AFTER THE LINE'S
000800* RAT<LINE>01 PROGRAM HAS SET THE BASE PREMIUM. EACH RULE IS ONE
000900* PARAGRAPH; THE SECTION FOR THE POLICY'S LINE RUNS EVERY RULE IN
001000* ORDER. A RULE THAT FIRES ADDS A LOADING OR A DISCOUNT, OR SETS
001100* THE REFER FLAG, AND RECORDS ITS ID IN RATE-LAST-RULE.
001200* 9000-CAPS LIMITS LOADINGS TO 150% AND DISCOUNTS TO 40% OF BASE.
001300* RULES IN RETIRED-RULES ARE NEVER PERFORMED. THEY ARE KEPT
001400* BECAUSE AUDIT ASKED FOR THE HISTORY (2022).
001500* MEMO IDS (UW-YYYY-NNN) ARE UNDERWRITING COMMITTEE DECISIONS.
001600*================================================================
